OL,3,GNEWSAMinister criticises Belfast IT
OL,4,Afirm's notification delay over credit
OL,5,Aunions data breach
OL,6,
OL,7,FCredit unions across the island of
OL,8,FIreland affected by a data breach were
OL,9,Ftold about it by a Belfast-based IT
OL,10,Ffirm weeks after it occurred, an Irish
OL,11,Fgovernment minister has said.
OL,13,FRobert Troy said the affected credit
OL,14,Funions were told on Tuesday by the firm
OL,15,FWellington IT, a delay he described as
OL,16,F"not acceptable".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
