OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMinister criticises Belfast IT
OL,4,Afirm's notification delay over credit
OL,5,Aunions data breach
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said he has written to Wellington IT
OL,8,Frequesting a meeting and added that
OL,9,Fcurrently no financial loss has been
OL,10,Fexperienced by any credit union or
OL,11,Ftheir members, but the full extent of
OL,12,Fwhat has happened is still being
OL,13,Festablished.
OL,15,FWellington IT said it alerted its
OL,16,Fcustomers as soon as it had "confirmed
OL,17,Fthe potential risk" and an
OL,18,Finvestigation is under way.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
